{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r2-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "commit 19a3036f893fe27c35c39bce0e98e080a731ddae\nAuthor: adage-eval <adage-eval@localhost>\nDate:   Mon Sep 28 03:46:35 2026 +0000\n\n    Fix back-to-back berth booking rejection (INC-94)\n    \n    The overlap detection was using <= which incorrectly rejected bookings that\n    started exactly when another ended. Changed to < so touching boundaries don't\n    count as overlaps, allowing planners to book consecutive vessels on the same\n    berth without gaps.\n    \n    Added test case to verify back-to-back bookings are accepted.\n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n src/berths/schedule.ts | 2 +-\n test/berths.test.ts    | 7 +++++++\n 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01C4hDJtZCFKxDP5VjgFVLb8", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "77470992-97c2-4168-a540-884d515a2eea", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:46:37.901Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "commit 19a3036f893fe27c35c39bce0e98e080a731ddae\nAuthor: adage-eval <adage-eval@localhost>\nDate:   Mon Sep 28 03:46:35 2026 +0000\n\n    Fix back-to-back berth booking rejection (INC-94)\n    \n    The overlap detection was using <= which incorrectly rejected bookings that\n    started exactly when another ended. Changed to < so touching boundaries don't\n    count as overlaps, allowing planners to book consecutive vessels on the same\n    berth without gaps.\n    \n    Added test case to verify back-to-back bookings are accepted.\n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n src/berths/schedule.ts | 2 +-\n test/berths.test.ts    | 7 +++++++\n 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)"}, "type": "user"}
